            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "[V2G20-2431] If the named group and signature algorithm selected for the TLS session are based on curves as defined by [V2G20-2319] (as per the configurable mechanism as defined by [V2G20-2320]), the vehicle certificate chain provided by the EVCC in the \"Certificate\" message shall be based on profiles as defined in B.8.2.",
            "block_bbox": [
                136,
