        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "[V2G20-2432] The public SECC shall validate, according to according to [V2G20-1001], [V2G20-2324] and [V2G20-2325], the certificate chain that was provided by the EVCC during the TLS handshake. During the EVCC certificate chain validation the public SECC shall check revocation status of the certificates in the EVCC's certificate chain.",
